#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:14
#: b735c41863c04ecf8c16a96784b6a9f3
msgid "One issue with this frame is that there is some play in the motors which leads to a slightly wobble when standing still.  This could be resolved by using `stepper motors <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9172>`__"
msgstr ""

